        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(usage-bar): evict oldest template cache entry when full",
        "body": "Related: #98960\n\n## What Problem This Solves\nModule-level `fileCache` Map grew unbounded with live `fs.watch` watchers never cleaned up.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\nAdd `MAX_CACHED_TEMPLATES=32`, evict oldest + close watcher before inserting.\n\n## User Impact\nPrevents unbounded watcher/memory growth when templates are loaded from changing paths.\n\n## Evidence\n![proof](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhangLei99586/openclaw/proof-screenshots/pr-all-6-proof.png)\n\n- Runtime: `MAX_CACHED_TEMPLATES=32` defined + eviction check at `fileCache.set` time\n- `translator.test.ts`: 13/13 passed",
